"""Passes 3795-3812: exact W33/ovoid/coherent/Leech/axial closure.

The verifier reuses the published Passes 3769-3786 geometry source as an
executable substrate, exposes its internally constructed finite objects, and
then performs five queued fronts plus three independent constructions.

Concrete Monster/mmgroup words, a Monster class fusion, Griess/VOA structure,
and physical or hardware claims remain fail-closed.
"""
